<title>ITALY: Generali in alliance with Ravenna bank.</title>
<headline>Generali in alliance with Ravenna bank.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian insurance group Generali and Cassa Risparmio di Ravenna have signed a cooperation accord to offer financial and insurance products through the northeast savings bank, a joint statement said.</p>
<p>At the same time, Generalie will take a 13.5 stake in the Ravenna bank's holding Societa Finanziaria di Banche Romagnole. No financial details were given.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
